    # About This Site

    This site was created using [nanoc](https://nanoc.app) static website generator .
    It is based on the [nancoc3 blog](https://github.com/mgutz/nanoc3_blog)
    starter kit developed by [mgutz](http://github.com/mgutz)
    ([Licence](license.html)).
    I have significantly modified the starter kit, and have updated to work with
    [nanoc v4.14](https://github.com/nanoc/nanoc/releases/tag/4.14.7).
    The HTML pages are generated from a set of
    [haml](https://haml.info/docs.html) and
    [markdown](http://daringfireball.net/projects/markdown/) files, while CSS is
    generated from [sass](http://sass-lang.com/) files.

    The structure of the site is inspired from
    [Mark Reid](http://mark.reid.name/)'s home page.

    All the inset images are public domain and are obtained 
    from [Open Clipart](https://openclipart.org).

    The source code of this website is available at 
    [github repository](https://github.com/srirampc/pwp).

